# Arch Linux packages (pacman)
#
# The Linux half of install/Brewfile. Read only through `bin/manifest list
# pacman`; installed by `bin/install-kind pacman` (`make arch`).
#
# One bare lowercase package name per line. Every name here is installed by
# `make test-docker-arch` (CI's Container (arch) job) under STRICT_PACKAGES,
# so one that stops resolving fails the gate. All of them must come from the
# official core/extra repos, because `pacman -S` cannot reach the AUR.
# Anything Arch ships only in the AUR is not listed here at all.
#
# A package also listed in another manifest carries its rationale there
# (install/README.md § Entry format); only Arch-only names carry one here.
#
# Arch names differ from Homebrew's. The renames are deliberate:
#   gh -> github-cli    jj -> jujutsu        node -> nodejs
#   poetry -> python-poetry                  pipx -> python-pipx
#   haskell-stack -> stack                   sphinx-doc -> python-sphinx
#   pandoc -> pandoc-cli                     tbb -> onetbb
#   typos-cli -> typos  timewarrior -> timew spotify_player -> spotify-player
#   telnet -> inetutils freetype -> freetype2  glib -> glib2

